@startuml US_3_2_2_C3_Impl
title US 3.2.2 - Implementação de role loading

component AuthSvc as "AuthService\ncheckAuth() + /api/auth/role"
component Layout as "LayoutComponent\nupdateDisplayedMenu()"
component Storage as "localStorage auth_token"
component Guard as "AuthGuard"

AuthSvc --> Storage : persist user + roles
AuthSvc --> Layout : loggedIn$ emit
Layout --> AuthSvc : fetch roles, normalize(admin/operator/agent/authority)
Guard --> AuthSvc : read role for canActivate

@enduml
